{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'nl -ba packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/team-impl-log.md'","aggregated_output":"     1\t# Team Impl Log — Epic 02: Derivation Pipeline\n     2\t\n     3\tState: STORY_ACTIVE\n     4\tCurrent Story: 00-foundation\n     5\tCurrent Phase: implement (story-orchestrate run launched 2026-06-11T03:01Z, background task bxf5tdlko, monitor beur71wht)\n     6\tSpec-Pack Root: /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline\n     7\tRun Started: 2026-06-11T03:00Z (caller harness: Claude Code, impl-lead)\n     8\t\n     9\t## Setup Record\n    10\t\n    11\t### Spec pack\n    12\t- inspect: `ready` (artifacts/inspect/001-inspect.json). Tech-design shape: **two-file** (tech-design.md + test-plan.md).\n    13\t- Story inventory (in order): 00-foundation, 01-queue-execution-drain, 02-message-level-derivation, 03-turn-composition-chunk-formation, 04-derivation-state-report-repair, 05-message-edit-cascade, 06-message-turn-delete.\n    14\t- Prompt inserts: both absent (non-blocking).\n    15\t- All 7 stories + coverage.md + test-plan.md read in full before story work.\n    16\t\n    17\t### Configuration (impl-run.config.json, validated by preflight 002)\n    18\t- primary_harness: claude-code (authenticated, v2.1.172)\n    19\t- secondary: codex available (codex-cli 0.139.0; auth status unknown — proceed-if-works note from preflight)\n    20\t- story_lead_provider: codex / gpt-5.5 / high\n    21\t- story_implementor: none (claude) / claude-fable-5 / medium\n    22\t- quick_fixer: none / claude-opus-4-8 / xhigh\n    23\t- story_verifier: codex / gpt-5.5 / xhigh\n    24\t- epic_verifiers: epic-reviewer-1 = claude-fable-5 xhigh; epic-reviewer-2 = codex gpt-5.5 xhigh\n    25\t- epic_reverifier: claude-fable-5 xhigh\n    26\t- self_review passes: 3. Timeouts: skill defaults.\n    27\t- No degraded-diversity condition (Codex present).\n    28\t\n    29\t### Verification gates\n    30\t- Story gate: `pnpm run green-verify` — source: explicit CLI flag to preflight; rationale: every story file's §Verification names green-verify as the story gate; the test-immutability guard is compatible because red-manifest regeneration is a sanctioned story step (Story 0 and Story 2 amendments, test-plan §Sanctioned Amendments). Candidates considered: `verify` (skill default when guard exists) vs `green-verify` (spec-pack policy) — spec pack won.\n    31\t- Epic gate: `pnpm run verify-all` — source: explicit CLI flag; named by every story's §Verification and runs the process suite (LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1).\n    32\t- Gates run from `packages/lhc/`. Preflight persisted verification_gates into impl-run.config.json (expected side effect).\n    33\t\n    34\t### Cumulative baseline\n    35\t- Pre-epic baseline: Epic 01 suite = 118 tests (per spec pack; verify at Story 0 gate). Expected epic-end ≈ 178–188.\n    36\t\n    37\t## Retained Operating Notes (compaction-safe)\n    38\t\n    39\t- Impl-lead never implements/verifies; CLI runs bounded ops; acceptance + final gates + recovery strategy never delegated.\n    40\t- Story cycle per story: `story-orchestrate validate` → `story-orchestrate run` (background, monitor via runtime progress artifacts + 5-min Monitor cadence; never rely on memory) → review final package → route fixes (story-continue / quick-fix / fresh implementor / escalate) → run story gate myself → write receipt with dispositions (fixed / accepted-risk / defer) → commit → advance.\n    41\t- Closeout: epic-review → curate fix batch (only if current canonical review justifies) → epic-fix → epic-reverify loop → epic gate (verify-all) → mark COMPLETE.\n    42\t- Pause for user: missing files, ambiguous gates, unresolved verifier/implementor disagreement, unclear replay boundary, product-judgment findings.\n    43\t- Epic facts: 47 ACs / 46 TCs, deps 0→1→2→3→(4,5)→6. Architecture-risk four: TC-1.3 (SIGKILL restart), TC-1.4 (cross-process claim exclusion), TC-5.4 (stale-result/source-version), TC-3.9 (chunk determinism). Sanctioned Epic 01 amendments ONLY: Story 0 versioned work-item ids (`w-…-v<n>` sweep + red-manifest regen), Story 2 tool_call queueing (3→4 rows). Anything else = ruling.\n    44\t- Test substrate: provider double at production seam; spawned tests use LHC_PROVIDER registry path; manual-mode SDK with budget 3 / backoff 0 / lease 200ms default; process suite gated by LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1.\n    45\t- Worktree was clean at run start (commit 823a48c, spec pack committed).\n    46\t\n    47\t## Story Log\n    48\t\n    49\t### 00-foundation\n    50\t- validate: ready (artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json). Baseline seed before story: 353 test files (workspace-wide count, runtime metric). Epic 01 functional baseline: 118 tests.\n    51\t- run: launched 2026-06-11T03:01Z (002-story-orchestrate-run.json); implementor child dispatched (003-implementor.json); status running/running_child_operation.\n    52\t- User authorized full autonomous run through epic completion (overnight).\n    53\t- 03:27Z terminal `needs-ruling` (ruling-012, test-scope-amendment-ratification): implementor changed thread-migration.test.ts schemaVersionOf assertions 4→5 (migration v5 consequence). Verifier finding 00F-001; all gates reported green by verifier; baseline 132→155.\n    54\t- 03:30Z impl-lead RULING: ratified (ruling-012-response.json, decision ratify-schema-version-assertion-edits) — mechanical consequence of FC-0.5's migration v5 deliverable, same spirit as sanctioned versioned-id amendments. Resumed via story-orchestrate resume (first attempt rejected INVALID_RULING — schema needs rulingRequestId/decision/source; corrected and resubmitted).\n    55\t\n    56\t## Epic Closeout\n    57\t\n    58\t(pending)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
