ches containing `tool_call` (sweep `queuedWork`/`rawWorkItemCount` usages during Story 2 red phase and list each amendment in the story's deviation table).\n   111\t\n   112\tNo other Epic 01 test changes are sanctioned; anything further found necessary is a ruling, not an edit.\n   113\t\n   114\t## Architecture-Risk Tests\n   115\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
